!SENTENCES REQUIRING TRANSLATION
The sentences here will be used in the upcoming modules for ((Parallel 2)).

Feel free to add your translation to any of the sentences (use Edit), specifying your nick, in the following format:

__EXAMPLE:__

__000. Tim loves Ann.__

la tim. prami la .an.  ''-inego''
  
la tim. nelci la .en.  ''-zo'e''

By the way, does anyone know an analogue for HTML's <br>? It would be better to use it here...

---

Here are the sentences:

__001. In January, New Year is celebrated.__

__002. On 10th I begin working ''(after vacation)''.__

__003. On 24th I stop smoking.__

__004. On 30th I will fly to Florida.__